CORPSES, LOOT AND SACRIFICE — IN DEVELOPMENT
These physical-corpse commands are NOT enabled in this build.
Planned commands:
  loot corpse       release the contents to the room and consume the corpse
  sacrifice corpse  same loot release; requires a confirmed assigned deity
  raise corpse      Necromancer only; 8 mana, inherited HP/MP, no timer
A corpse will release its gold/inventory only once. Pet remains will never
create loot, XP, additional summons or deity favor. Favor is not implemented.
Current private playtest summon: raise skeleton (see help raise skeleton).
